### 전체 주제 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/theme
Accept: application/json

### 주제명으로 주제 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/theme/name?keyword=사랑
Accept: application/json

### 주제 ID 단일 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/theme/1
Accept: application/json

### 주제 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/theme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "인간관계"
}

### 주제 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/theme/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "학업"
}

### 주제 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/theme/12